  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. I stand before you\ntoday<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwith<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmost<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndesperate<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nrequest.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 19,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And I’m afraid it is a personal one. You see, I must\nget a certain Pokémon for my daughter’s birthday.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "She absolutely must have a <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Mimikyu<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006800650020006100620073006F006C007500740065006C00790020006D0075007300740020006800610076006500200061002000100002FF000006004D0069006D0069006B0079007500100002FF000000002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I tried explaining that Mimikyu are nocturnal—\nand perhaps not the best Pokémon for a young<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nchild to look after.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "She replied that if I did not get her one, she would\ninsist I give back my precious hair tie.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, this hair tie is in fact a gift from my daughter.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nShe crafted it by hand, felting Mareep wool to\ncreate an adorable work of art.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It is what people know me by. It has become part\nof my very identity. I cannot have her take it back.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Unfortunately, Mimikyu are not found in the Kalos\nregion.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut perhaps in Hyperspace Lumiose...you might\njust be able to find one there.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you do find a Mimikyu, please—would you\ncatch it and allow me to gift it to my daughter?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you have a Mimikyu I can give to my daughter?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F007500200068006100760065002000610020004D0069006D0069006B0079007500200049002000630061006E0020006700690076006500200074006F0020006D0079002000640061007500670068007400650072003F001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve got one",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004920190076006500200067006F00740020006F006E00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not yet...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007900650074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know I should not bother you with a family\nmatter, but please! I must have a Mimikyu.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You have my lifelong thanks for this.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000680061007600650020006D00790020006C006900660065006C006F006E00670020007400680061006E006B007300200066006F007200200074006800690073002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mimikyu has the Fairy type, making it strong\nagainst Dragon types.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069006D0069006B007900750020006800610073002000740068006500200046006100690072007900200074007900700065002C0020006D0061006B0069006E00670020006900740020007300740072006F006E0067000A0061006700610069006E0073007400200044007200610067006F006E002000740079007000650073002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perhaps someday my daughter will also grow into\na fine Trainer and challenge me and my Drampa...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That will be the true test of my “dadication,” as it\nwere!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074002000770069006C006C002000620065002000740068006500200074007200750065002000740065007300740020006F00660020006D00790020201C00640061006400690063006100740069006F006E002C201D002000610073002000690074000A00770065007200650021001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Thank you, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, for all the\nmany<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nways<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwhich<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\naid<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nme,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ngreat<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nand<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsmall!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 27,
